# Bot1's Merseine enchants Bot2's Llanowar Elves and enters with three net counters. Only the creature's controller may
# activate it (CR 602.2): Bot1, who controls the Aura, can't; Bot2 can't either while it has only blue mana, since the cost
# is the Elves' mana cost, {G}, colored symbol and all (the ruling), and with green mana Bot2 pays exactly {G} for each
# counter. The Elves, tapped for mana, stay tapped through Bot2's untap step while a net counter is on the Aura (CR 502.3),
# and untap in the first untap step after the last one is gone.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Merseine
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Llanowar Elves
Forest
Mox Sapphire
Forest
Forest
Island
Island
Island x20
